1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:03,200
(Sheldon:)That's what
tertiary friends are for.

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:07,930
(Raj(inside):)Who is it?

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,140
(Leonard:)It's Leonard.

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,640
(Raj:)You can't come in.

5
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,870
(Leonard:)I just want to talk to her.

6
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,310
(Raj:)I forbid it.

7
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:16,660
(Priya:)Open the door,
Rajesh.

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,830
(Raj:)You heard me.

9
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:20,010
(Raj:)I forbidded it.

10
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,810
"Forbidded" it?

11
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,750
"Forbaded" it?

12
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:26,420
(Priya:)Get out of the way.

13
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,420
(Priya:)What are you doing here?

14
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,860
What are you doing here?

15
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,220
(Priya:)I have business in Los Angeles.

16
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:32,730
(Leonard:)Why didn't you call?

17
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:34,290
(Raj:)Clearly, she was
sending you a message

18
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:36,560
(Raj:)to take a hike, Mike.

19
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,370
(Howard:)I'm sorry.
I thought about calling,

20
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:42,370
(Priya:)but I just wasn't sure if
seeing you was such a good idea.

21
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,800
(Leonard:)I know. Last time
I came on too strong.

22
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:46,110
(Leonard:)Can we talk in private?

23
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:48,170
(Raj:)No!
Sure.

24
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:51,140
(Raj:)It's completely inappropriate
for a single woman

25
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,450
(Raj:)to entertain a man in private.

26
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:55,350
(Raj:)If you insist on talking,
you must do it on the couch!

27
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,720
(Raj:)All right, you may talk in
the bedroom,

28
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,090
(Raj:)but I want this door
to remain open!

